# .azure is not intended to be committed
*

# Two exceptions.
#
# This file itself, so the exceptions survive a fresh clone. Without it the
# negation below is untracked and the plan silently disappears again.
#
# The deployment plan, which is review material rather than azd state. Everything
# else here is machine written environment state that azd owns and that correctly
# stays out of version control: config.json, the per environment directories, and
# the .env files inside them, which hold deployment specific values.
#
# The assembled application package and the generated preflight evidence are also
# excluded, both by the rule above and explicitly in the root .gitignore, because
# both are regenerated on every run.
!.gitignore
!deployment-plan.md
